rows={1224:prior_rows[1224],
1242:r('POST delivery/{id}/assign overwrites body DeliveryId and calls AssignDeliveryHandler. Event delivery-assignment-RequestId replay is checked before actor authorization and returns the currently requested delivery state, without payload binding. New work authorizes body ActorUserId for delivery_manage, starts ReadCommitted transaction and locks delivery. Only Ready is accepted; active driver eligibility is checked via AssertDriverAssignable(driver,employee:null), meaning employee-linked drivers would fail rather than silently bypass eligibility. It atomically sets OutForDelivery, driver/handover snapshot, auto trip/time/version, optional cash custody, assignment event, DriverDispatch Pending print job and audit. This treats operator assignment as physical handover; no hardware/driver acknowledgement is observed.',
 'Path id dominates DeliveryId; RequestId,DriverId,ActorUserId,approval IDs; cancellation.', '200 AssignDeliveryResult(DeliveryId,Status,DriverId,DriverName,TripId,WasReplayed);422 domain/eligibility;404 missing actor/delivery/order;409 DeliveryConflict.', 'Delivery/custody/event/dispatch print job/audit in one commit; no order payment/stock/treasury movement here.', 'SEC001 body actor permission sink. Independent token required when selected actor lacks permission. Replay returns without reauthorization but creates no new assignment.', 'AssignDeliveryHandler36-151: event replay; locked target delivery64-67; required order read; single save135/commit136; DbUpdate rollback and event replay or typed conflict.', 'Ready immediately becomes OutForDelivery, without separate handover screen; Pending dispatch slip does not prove driver received paper/food.', 'One delivery row lock, driver/order reads and batched writes; no device/network I/O inside SQL transaction.', 'Deterministic event/auto-trip/custody/print IDs prevent same-key insertion duplicate. A reused key with changed DeliveryId can return unrelated current delivery as replay; no immutable request payload comparison. Different IDs on already dispatched order fail Ready guard.', ['Replay response not bound to original delivery payload','SEC001 body identity','Dispatch ticket queued versus physical handover distinction'], ['Concurrent same/different request assignment; inactive/employee-linked driver; reused request key another delivery; zero-custody prepaid branch and one dispatch job'], ['Program.cs1242-1262 -> AssignDeliveryHandler.HandleAsync(AssignDeliveryRequest,CancellationToken)','Infrastructure/Delivery/AssignDeliveryHandler.cs36-154','Domain/Delivery/DeliveryRules.cs11-20 CreateCashCustody,169-175 AssertDriverAssignable','Domain/Delivery/DeliveryStatus.cs13-31 transitions','Application/Delivery/DeliveryRequests.cs AssignDeliveryRequest/Result']),
1264:r('POST delivery/{id}/reassign replaces body DeliveryId and invokes ReassignDeliveryHandler. History-ID replay precedes actor checks; otherwise body actor is loaded and delivery update-locked. It requires existing driver, active target and nonblank reason. Same target driver returns no-op before status/permission checks, so it performs no change even for terminal status. Real transfer rejects Settled/Cancelled, derives delivery_override for Delivered/Failed/Returned versus delivery_manage in flight, and verifies the corresponding selected-actor/approval authority. It relabels existing unsettled custody rather than cloning money, changes delivery driver snapshot/time/version, adds reassignment history/event/audit and a new dispatch job in one transaction.',
 'Path id overrides body DeliveryId; RequestId,NewDriverId,Reason,ActorUserId,approval IDs.', '200 ReassignDeliveryResult(DeliveryId,DriverId,DriverName,WasReplayed,WasNoOp);422 domain;404 missing actor/delivery/order;409 conflict.', 'Changes driver attribution of delivery and unsettled custody, inserts transfer/event/audit/dispatch job; no new custody principal or treasury inflow.', 'SEC001 actor sink; action permission selected from locked persisted status, not client flag. Same-driver early no-op skips permission but has no write.', 'ReassignDeliveryHandler34-155: ReadCommitted, UPDLOCK target; custody first matching DeliveryId; one save137/commit138. Existing settled custody not relabeled. No separate employee eligibility call on target beyond Active predicate here.', 'New DriverDispatch job supports replacement slip; no physical send occurs in route. Prior assignment is retained in history.', 'Row lock serializes per-order transfer, several metadata reads and inserts; history grows by actual changes only.', 'History key RequestId dedupes actual transfer; same-driver no-op writes no key/history and therefore later reuse can execute after state changes. Replay response uses current requested delivery rather than original history payload.', ['Employee-linked assign eligibility stronger than reassign Active-only check','Replay payload not bound','No-op permission bypass is no-mutation counterevidence'], ['Post-outcome override versus in-flight manage; settled/cancelled real transfer blocked; same-driver no-op; same-key different payload; custody conserved and single replacement job'], ['Program.cs1264-1284 -> ReassignDeliveryHandler.HandleAsync','Infrastructure/Delivery/ReassignDeliveryHandler.cs34-155','Domain/Authorization/ApprovalRegistry.cs AuthorizeCommand','Infrastructure/Printing/PrintJobQueryService.cs313-340 ComposeDriverDispatchAsync']),
1286:r('POST delivery/{id}/result overrides body DeliveryId then calls RecordDeliveryResultHandler. Event-ID replay happens first, then Result parses case-insensitively to only Delivered/Failed/Returned; body actor requires delivery_manage or valid approval. Target row is update-locked; already requested status commits no-op before recalculating collection, so a second Delivered submission cannot silently revise amount. Domain transition table enforces legal progression. Delivered computes expected via DeliveryCashResponsibility, defaults omitted collection to expected and requires nonnegative amount plus reason for variance; it updates delivery and existing custody collected/difference. Failed requires one of six reason codes, Returned nonblank reason. It appends event/audit atomically without marking Order paid or posting Treasury cash.',
 'Path id; RequestId,Result,CollectedAmountPiastres?,Reason?,Notes?,ActorUserId,approval IDs.', '200 RecordDeliveryResultResult(DeliveryId,Status,WasReplayed);422 invalid outcome/transition/reason/collection;404 missing actor/delivery/order;409 conflict.', 'Delivery outcome timestamp/status/version and optional custody collection updated; event and audit saved. No new custody when none exists, no customer refund, stock reversal or ledger movement.', 'SEC001 selected actor sink; authorization remains real for selected user and manager token separately validated. Caller-reported collection is observation, not verified physical cash.', 'RecordDeliveryResultHandler45-163 replay, transaction/UPDLOCK, save146/commit147; DbUpdate rollback attempts event replay else409.', 'Delivered records driver collection pending later Main settlement. Failed/Returned preserves money semantics; do not claim this sends refund or cancels sale.', 'One row lock plus order/optional custody reads; no printer work or financial account balance lock in result recording.', 'Same RequestId event dedupe plus same-status no-op; latter does not compare changed amount/reason and has WasReplayed=false. Reusing key with different delivery reads current requested row, not bound original payload.', ['Collection self-report and omitted amount default','Same-status correction silently no-op','SEC001 identity; payload-unbound replay'], ['Omitted/negative/variance collection; pending electronic cash interpretation; Failed->Returned allowed versus Delivered->Returned forbidden; changed-amount repeat; no treasury post until settlement'], ['Program.cs1286-1306 -> RecordDeliveryResultHandler.HandleAsync','Infrastructure/Delivery/RecordDeliveryResultHandler.cs45-163','Domain/Delivery/DeliveryRules.cs11 DeliveryCashResponsibility,83-89 AssertCollectionAmount','Domain/Delivery/DeliveryStatus.cs13-31 transitions']),
1308:r('POST drivers/{driverId}/settle overrides body DriverId then invokes SettleDriverCustodyHandler. It replays settlement key first, rejects negative ActualCash, authorizes selected actor delivery_manage, then begins transaction and locks full unsettled delivery and custody sets for this driver. Domain scope rejects any active delivery and rejects no resolved/custody work. Expected is collected custody sum, not gross sale value; variance requires written reason and extra delivery_settlement_approve authority. It requires open business day, posts positive actual as external-driver cash into Main with journal, marks custodies/resolved deliveries Settled, and writes settlement/events/audit in one commit. Zero actual still closes operational obligations without treasury movement. Driver row lookup is optional display data, not existence guard.',
 'Path driverId overrides body; RequestId,ActualCashPiastres,Reason?,ActorUserId,approval IDs.', '200 SettleDriverCustodyResult(SettlementId,DriverId,ExpectedPiastres,ActualPiastres,DifferencePiastres,OrderCount,TreasuryMovementId?,WasReplayed);422 domain/approval;404 actor;409 contention/conflict.', 'Atomically records actual Main inflow if positive, completes journal, marks custody/deliveries Settled, inserts financial/operational settlement/audit/events. No printing job in handler.', 'SEC001 actor sink; variance gate stacked on base permission and approval registry checks real action. Actual cash is operator-entered amount with reason/authority for discrepancy, not machine-observed.', 'SettleDriverCustodyHandler36-197: transaction64; parameterized UPDLOCK/HOLDLOCK both row sets; required orders dictionary; BusinessDayGate104; save172/commit173; rollback/replay and sibling wait on contention.', 'Clears all resolved obligations, including prepaid zero-cash deliveries; separate from shift closure. Successful API is not proof actual money handed over or voucher printed.', 'Locks all unsettled work per driver; orderId batch plus per-resolved event inserts. Same-driver concurrent settlement serialized; orphan order dictionary error can abort.', 'Unique key and locked scope prevent two distinct request IDs posting same existing scope. Same-key replay returns stored settlement before authorization. New in-flight work can block; read-only account CanSettle is not a reservation.', ['Optional driver existence differs account404','Reported cash versus independently observed custody','SEC001 actor; no physical receipt claim'], ['Concurrent same/different settlement IDs, zero-cash prepaid settlement, active order refusal, shortage reason/extra permission, rollback no partial cash, replay stored result'], ['Program.cs1308-1328 -> SettleDriverCustodyHandler.HandleAsync','Infrastructure/Delivery/SettleDriverCustodyHandler.cs36-197','Domain/Delivery/DeliveryRules.cs31-79 CalculateTripSettlement/BuildDriverSettlementScope','Infrastructure/BusinessDay/BusinessDayGate.cs RequireOpenAsync','Infrastructure/Persistence/EfFinancialJournal.cs TryStart/Complete'])
}
